title: "Reference-set dependence of lysine acylation co-occupancy claims"
abstract: "Analysis code and derived tables reproducing an audit of four reference sets for lysine acylation co-occupancy, using 88 lysine pyruvylation sites as a test case, together with leave-one-out comparisons across nine catalogued acylations."
